// AWS S3 Bucket Versioning Suspended  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1490
// Detects suspension of S3 bucket versioning (PutBucketVersioning). Disabling versioning removes the ability to recover overwritten/deleted…
// False positives: Deliberate, reviewed versioning configuration changes.
// Source: rules/impact/s3-suspend-bucket-versioning.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "PutBucketVersioning" and eventSource =~ "s3.amazonaws.com"
